{"id":"7644e449343b265a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-lem-pcf-binding.md","title":"PCF Binding Lemma","display":"lem-pcf-binding — PCF Binding Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-pcf-binding","aliases":["58-lem-pcf-binding"],"display":"lem-pcf-binding — PCF Binding Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-pcf-binding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-pcf-binding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-pcf-binding — PCF Binding Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f02dbef75736ea3\" href=\"?note=3f02dbef75736ea3\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md\">../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (nonempty set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)\\)</span> (possible cofinality)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pcf}\">\\(\\mathrm{pcf}\\)</span> (possible-cofinality operation from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf-binding}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists U,\\vec f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\theta,\\prod A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid\\vec f(\\xi)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\eta)(a)\\}\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)\\leq\\vec f(\\xi)(a)\\}\\in U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf-binding}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists U,\\vec f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\theta,\\prod A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid\\vec f(\\xi)(a)&lt;\\vec f(\\eta)(a)\\}\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)\\leq\\vec f(\\xi)(a)\\}\\in U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A possible cofinality is witnessed by an ultrafilter together with an increasing cofinal scale in the corresponding reduced product.</li>\n<li>The cofinality is expressed by the displayed increasing/cofinal scale itself. The previous term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\prod A/U,&lt;_{U})\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\prod A/U,&lt;_{U})\\)</span> incorrectly applied the unary ordinal-cofinality operation to an ordered quotient.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f02dbef75736ea3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-shelah-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}pcf-binding}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(a)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{pcf}(A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists U,\\vec f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,\\theta,\\prod A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall\\xi<\\eta<\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid\\vec f(\\xi)(a)<\\vec f(\\eta)(a)\\}\\in U\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}{}\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod A\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\theta\\;\n\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)\\leq\\vec f(\\xi)(a)\\}\\in U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\prod A/U,<_{U})","display":false}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3915","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-lem-pcf-binding.md|58-lem-pcf-binding]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["3f02dbef75736ea3","0fbfc19800246e77","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751"]}